,"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"phuryn","id":7837354,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MzczNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7837354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn","html_url":"https://github.com/phuryn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/commits/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","html_url":"https://github.com/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/commit/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6"}]},{"sha":"27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","node_id":"C_kwDOSuR139oAKDI3ZTlkYTIzNTYzNmU0MTdmN2EyNDRiYWJkNDFjOTkzNmE3NzI1YjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Pawel Huryn","email":"pawel.huryn@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-01T22:11:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Pawel Huryn","email":"pawel.huryn@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-01T22:11:16Z"},"message":"Real OpenAI hosted workflow benchmark: managed taxes three different layers\n\nThe OpenAI managed arm now invokes the real Agent Builder workflow\n(wf_68f0aace...) headlessly via POST /v1/workflows/{id}/run, replacing the\nResponses+code_interpreter proxy. Unlock: pass input_as_text alongside input,\nstream the run to recover usage/output (non-streaming result.output is null),\nand detect code use via code_interpreter_call output items (not the tool def).\n\nFinding (108 runs, N=6, FINDINGS §K-v2): \"managed\" is three pricing bets.\nGoogle taxes the sandbox (~5.3x, still 2.9x on a no-code task). Anthropic\nbarely taxes the loop (~1.2x, caching absorbs it). OpenAI taxes the code\n(~1x on reasoning, +$0.03 container only when code fires; the \"16x average\"\nwas one code task dragging up two near-free ones).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b03529065310eae1bac16ac599342e40f4532a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/git/trees/8b03529065310eae1bac16ac599342e40f4532a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/git/commits/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/commits/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","html_url":"https://github.com/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/commit/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/phuryn/managed-agents-experiment/commits/27e9da235636e417f7a244babd41c9936a7725b6/comments","author":{"login":"phuryn","id":7837354,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MzczNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7837354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn","html_url":"https://github.com/phuryn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phuryn